X Coin (XFER)

A peer-to-peer coin for users on X. No mining. Every minute a lottery
among verified active nodes produces the block. Fair launch, no premine.
One free root identity asset per verified X handle.

Wallet: the core node (`xcoind` / `xcoin-cli`). See README.md.
Paper: whitepaper/XCOIN.md.

Nifty Raven (@NFTRVN on X). Anonymous public release.
Handle and display name only.
